<title>UK: Legal &amp; General profits rise to 291.4 mln stg.</title>
<headline>Legal &amp; General profits rise to 291.4 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>				   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		16.57		  vs 14.68</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 11.13		  vs 9.76</p>
<p> Pretax		     1,937.0		vs 271.3</p>
<p> Operating result	 291.4		  vs 252.5</p>
<p> Life pretax		250.0		  vs 219.8</p>
<p>NOTE - Pre-tax profits include reclassification of shareholders retained capital of 1.402 billion stg. Pre-tax operating profits and earnings per share are based on continuing operations. Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 271 and 348 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - Legal &amp; General Plc</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
